  <String Id="ForeignText" Value="LBFO (t&#299;kla kar&#353;u grup&#275;&#353;ana) jau ir instal&#275;ts ar citu r&#299;ku, piem., Windows11LBFO. Feature Heist atst&#257;j to un t&#257; grupas nemain&#299;tas; LbfoAdmin darbojas ar to. Lai to aizst&#257;tu, izmantojiet tools\Migrate-FromWindows11LBFO.ps1 no https://github.com/motwok/FeatureHeistWin11. Izlaidiet LBFO un instal&#275;jiet p&#257;r&#275;j&#257;s atlas&#299;t&#257;s pakotnes vai atceliet." />
  <String Id="ForeignSkip" Value="&amp;Izlaist LBFO" />
  <String Id="ForeignOnly" Value="LBFO jau ir instal&#275;ts ar citu r&#299;ku (piem., Windows11LBFO) un ir vien&#299;g&#257; atlas&#299;t&#257; pakotne. Lai to aizst&#257;tu, izmantojiet tools\Migrate-FromWindows11LBFO.ps1 no https://github.com/motwok/FeatureHeistWin11." />
